                        <li>
                            <strong>Diagnostics</strong> - Debug and monitor your stores
                        </li>
                    </ol>

                    <h6 class="mt-4">Key Documentation:</h6>
                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <strong>CLAUDE.md</strong> - Project overview and guidelines
                        </li>
